Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:04.53,TL,,0,0,0,,年初四连败 年末第一次入围总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.53,0:00:05.91,TL,,0,0,0,,科博利的这一年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.91,0:00:08.90,TL,,0,0,0,,中间隔着多少次重新出发？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.35,0:00:10.97,TL,,0,0,0,,从联合杯到澳网
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.97,0:00:12.71,TL,,0,0,0,,再到蒙彼利埃和达拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.71,0:00:14.59,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}场单打连败
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.59,0:00:17.63,TL,,0,0,0,,这个赛季 他的开局很难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.01,0:00:22.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Fery's second break in the third set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N费里在第三盘第二次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:28.25,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Scoreline looking very, very positive for the Brit.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比分对这位英国选手非常有利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.61,0:00:49.83,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And on debut, Arthur Fery is through to the second round.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N澳网首秀 费里闯进第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.83,0:00:53.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's a huge win. Straight sets.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一场大胜 直落三盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.78,0:00:55.22,TL,,0,0,0,,直到德尔雷海滩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.22,0:00:58.04,TL,,0,0,0,,他才又连续赢球 打进四强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:00:59.78,TL,,0,0,0,,接下来的阿卡普尔科
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.78,0:01:02.61,TL,,0,0,0,,这一次 他把奖杯带走了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:05.77,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}击败蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.77,0:01:08.81,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下生涯首座硬地巡回赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.81,0:01:12.25,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}500{\fs68}分到手 赛季终于有了亮色
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:18.97,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Acapulco belongs to Flavio.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿卡普尔科 属于弗拉维奥
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.97,0:01:21.49,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Cobolli the champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N科博利 冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.25,0:01:25.91,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A second ATP 500 title.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第二座五百分赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.80,0:01:28.63,TL,,0,0,0,,印第安维尔斯第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.63,0:01:30.12,TL,,0,0,0,,迈阿密首战失利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:31.85,TL,,0,0,0,,蒙特卡洛第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.85,0:01:35.18,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}3{\fs68}月到{\fs78}4{\fs68}月 成绩仍有起伏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.62,0:01:38.37,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}月的慕尼黑 他在半决赛{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.37,0:01:40.68,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}击败兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.68,0:01:42.31,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛输给谢尔顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.31,0:01:44.72,TL,,0,0,0,,也拿到了{\fs78}330{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:57.60,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Ben Shelton is the 2026 BMW Open by Bitpanda champion here in Munich.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N谢尔顿是二〇二六年慕尼黑冠军！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:02:00.54,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Runner-up 12 months ago.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N十二个月前 他是亚军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.77,0:02:04.05,TL,,0,0,0,,马德里击败梅德韦杰夫 打进八强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.05,0:02:06.91,TL,,0,0,0,,罗马第三轮 汉堡首轮出局之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.91,0:02:09.24,TL,,0,0,0,,他带着起伏来到巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.69,0:02:12.56,TL,,0,0,0,,他先连赢{\fs78}5{\fs68}场 打进四强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.56,0:02:14.60,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛阿尔纳尔迪赛前退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.60,0:02:17.70,TL,,0,0,0,,科博利第一次站上大满贯决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.15,0:02:20.91,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛对面 又是兹维列夫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:22.11,TL,,0,0,0,,第四盘抢七
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.11,0:02:24.15,TL,,0,0,0,,科博利把比赛拖进决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.15,0:02:26.14,TL,,0,0,0,,冠军还没有分出
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.49,0:03:13.50,TL,,0,0,0,,第五盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 他与冠军擦肩
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:15.53,TL,,0,0,0,,法网亚军的{\fs78}1300{\fs68}分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.53,0:03:18.68,TL,,0,0,0,,是他本季最大的一笔单站积分
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.12,0:03:22.41,TL,,0,0,0,,哈雷首轮出局 温网又打进八强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:24.61,TL,,0,0,0,,第四轮{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘淘汰德米纳尔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.61,0:03:26.61,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛输给费里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.61,0:03:28.94,TL,,0,0,0,,连续第二年停在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.24,0:03:36.26,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Oh, what days these are for Arthur Fery!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N费里迎来了多么美好的日子！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.04,0:03:45.04,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The British wild card in the semi-finals of Wimbledon.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这位英国外卡选手 闯进温网半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:47.93,TL,,0,0,0,,乌马格和加拿大站都没赢球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.93,0:03:51.07,TL,,0,0,0,,来到辛辛那提 他连续{\fs78}4{\fs68}场打满{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.07,0:03:53.59,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次闯进大师赛四强
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.04,0:03:55.97,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛逆转保罗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.97,0:03:57.93,TL,,0,0,0,,半决赛输给菲斯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.93,0:03:59.05,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}400{\fs68}分到手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.05,0:04:02.58,TL,,0,0,0,,科博利继续向第一次年终总决赛靠近
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:11.70,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is Arthur Fils into the final here in Cincinnati.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N菲斯打进辛辛那提决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.33,0:04:14.29,TL,,0,0,0,,美网首轮 两盘落后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.29,0:04:17.20,TL,,0,0,0,,他连扳{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘击败科梅萨尼亚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.20,0:04:19.63,TL,,0,0,0,,第二轮再逆转斯库尔凯特
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:22.03,TL,,0,0,0,,第三轮输给布洛克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.93,0:04:31.53,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}One of the performances of Alexander Blockx's career.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N布洛克斯职业生涯的代表作之一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.11,0:04:35.35,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}One of the performances in the U.S. Open so far.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也是本届美网至今的代表作之一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.08,0:04:40.24,TL,,0,0,0,,北京 上海首战出局
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:43.00,TL,,0,0,0,,冲刺年终的路又有起伏
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.44,0:04:46.38,TL,,0,0,0,,里昂半决赛 穆塞蒂救下{\fs78}4{\fs68}个赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.38,0:04:49.04,TL,,0,0,0,,将科博利挡在决赛之外
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:52.25,TL,,0,0,0,,维也纳伤退 又退出巴黎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:54.15,TL,,0,0,0,,巴黎当地{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}3{\fs68}日晚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:55.56,TL,,0,0,0,,鲁德击败霍达尔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.56,0:04:58.22,TL,,0,0,0,,科博利首次锁定年终资格
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.67,0:05:01.45,TL,,0,0,0,,门票在场外落定 通往都灵的路
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:03.51,TL,,0,0,0,,是他一场场打出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.51,0:05:04.46,TL,,0,0,0,,第一次年终
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.46,0:05:06.87,TL,,0,0,0,,在意大利的主场球迷面前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.87,0:05:08.84,TL,,0,0,0,,他还能走多远？
